{"created": "2026-09-18T20:20:15.444180+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-30T20:59:28.821926+00:00", "id": 22826419, "conceptrecid": "22826418", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22826419", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22826418", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22826419", "metadata": {"title": "\u03b6(5) is irrational", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22826419", "publication_date": "2026-09-17", "description": "<p>We prove that &zeta;(5) is irrational. The proof constructs integer polynomials Q\u2099 of degree 37n with 0 &lt; Q\u2099(&zeta;(5)) &lt; exp(&minus;139n&sup2;/5) for all sufficiently large n. These polynomials are rationally normalized Hankel determinants. A positive moment representation gives nonvanishing and, through a logarithmic-energy estimate, bounds their real values. Local estimates for the entire rational functional control the coefficients and show that the normalization preserves the required decay. A perturbation estimate also gives |&zeta;(5) &minus; a/b| &gt; b\u207b&sup2;\u2076\u2070 for every integer a and all sufficiently large positive integers b.</p>\n<p>Version note: This Zenodo record preserves the initial public preprint version. Subsequent revisions will be maintained on arXiv once the paper is announced there.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Fauzan, Aabir", "affiliation": "Aalto University", "orcid": "0009-0001-1673-9710"}], "keywords": ["Riemann zeta function", "irrationality", "zeta values", "Diophantine approximation", "number theory"], "version": "v1", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22826418"}}]}, "notes": "<p>This version records the initial presentation of the main construction and argument, while the full manuscript is in preparation. A draft will be linked here when available.</p>"}, "title": "\u03b6(5) is irrational", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22826419", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22826419?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22826419", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22826419", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22826419", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826418", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22826418", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22826418", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22826418", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419:ZETA5_IS_IRRATIONAL.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419:ZETA5_IS_IRRATIONAL.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419:ZETA5_IS_IRRATIONAL.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419:ZETA5_IS_IRRATIONAL.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419:ZETA5_IS_IRRATIONAL.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22826419:ZETA5_IS_IRRATIONAL.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22826419/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22826419/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo